WEBVTT

00:05.150 --> 00:07.610
Great job today, everyone!

00:07.610 --> 00:08.480
Yep!

00:08.480 --> 00:11.490
I have a feeling I'm getting better at this.

00:11.490 --> 00:14.200
Summer vacation will be over soon,

00:14.200 --> 00:16.370
but we have to keep improving at basketball.

00:16.370 --> 00:17.830
Oh!

00:17.830 --> 00:19.620
We certainly do!

00:19.620 --> 00:20.450
Hehe.

00:20.450 --> 00:22.000
Seems like everyone's pumped!

00:22.460 --> 00:25.500
Oh, by the way, are the summer festival preparations going well?

00:25.500 --> 00:28.340
No problems here! Got my yukata ready too!

00:28.670 --> 00:31.010
I asked my mom for help already.

00:31.260 --> 00:35.050
Oh! Hina's obi has goldfish on it!

00:35.470 --> 00:38.550
It's the last event of the summer holidays, right?

00:38.760 --> 00:41.520
The people in my district are all hyped up too.

00:41.520 --> 00:43.020
I'm sure it'll be a blast.

00:43.020 --> 00:45.770
I'm going to eat lots of sweet apricots this year too!

00:45.770 --> 00:47.060
Oh!

00:47.060 --> 00:48.560
I'll have some too.

00:48.560 --> 00:50.400
I wanna scoop some goldfishes.

00:50.400 --> 00:52.990
Let's make some nice memories.

00:52.990 --> 00:54.530
You got it!

00:56.530 --> 00:59.660
Make them see that halation!

00:59.660 --> 01:03.080
We'll carry out the oath we made that day.

01:03.080 --> 01:06.120
Spread out, new formation!

01:06.120 --> 01:09.630
We can see the signs as we call out for one another.

01:09.630 --> 01:15.880
Place your hopes in it, shoot, and watch the arch!

01:16.170 --> 01:20.800
I believe in you, do it like you always do.

01:20.800 --> 01:22.470
Leave it to me.

01:22.470 --> 01:29.020
Put your hands on your chest, and calm yourself down.

01:29.020 --> 01:35.360
I remember each and every granted wish,

01:35.360 --> 01:41.240
including that day I cried in secret.

01:41.240 --> 01:44.700
We're not the only ones

01:44.700 --> 01:48.290
seeing these same dreams.

01:48.290 --> 01:51.920
The sparks in those unyielding eyes

01:51.920 --> 01:55.050
that appeared in front of me,

01:55.050 --> 01:56.590
let them fly!

01:56.880 --> 02:00.010
Make them see that halation!

02:00.010 --> 02:03.390
Run into that open space!

02:03.390 --> 02:10.020
This lingering sensation, looking back on those carefree days.

02:10.020 --> 02:16.570
After saying farewell, you smile with everyone else,

02:16.570 --> 02:22.820
aim for the place you dreamed of, shoot, and watch the arch!

02:24.990 --> 02:29.790
Innocent World

02:38.720 --> 02:43.760
<i>It's been three months since I started coaching these five girls at Keishin Academy.</i>

02:44.810 --> 02:49.100
<i>Quite some time has passed, but it's gone by so fast.</i>

02:49.100 --> 02:51.690
<i>However, it's been a very fulfilling experience.</i>

02:54.320 --> 02:57.320
<i>These girls have taught me many important lessons.</i>

02:57.320 --> 03:00.700
<i>The time we've spent together is precious to me.</i>

03:11.750 --> 03:12.420
Here!

03:13.420 --> 03:15.750
<i>Our shooting guard, Minato Tomoka.</i>

03:17.210 --> 03:19.340
<i>Point guard, Nagatsuka Saki.</i>

03:23.390 --> 03:25.600
<i>Center, Kashii Airi.</i>

03:29.850 --> 03:32.310
<i>The small forward, Hakamada Hinata.</i>

03:36.770 --> 03:38.980
<i>And finally, the power forward, Misawa Maho.</i>

03:52.460 --> 03:54.290
<i>These girls are without a doubt,</i>

03:54.290 --> 03:56.500
<i>improving day by day.</i>

03:59.880 --> 04:01.300
Girls,

04:01.970 --> 04:04.220
I brought some food.

04:04.220 --> 04:05.890
Yay!

04:10.680 --> 04:12.230
Thank you for the food!

04:15.480 --> 04:17.190
This tastes great!

04:17.190 --> 04:18.520
Oh!

04:21.860 --> 04:23.900
Be sure to eat your fill, everyone.

04:23.900 --> 04:25.820
Will do!

04:27.780 --> 04:30.040
Miho-nee seems to be quite the Samaritan.

04:30.040 --> 04:33.250
As their advisor, it's the least I can do.

04:33.250 --> 04:35.080
But since you're not a student,

04:35.080 --> 04:37.000
you have no right to be eating this!

04:38.420 --> 04:41.010
It seems that I was wrong about you...

04:41.010 --> 04:43.340
Airi-chan's grown braver.

04:44.170 --> 04:46.050
Thank you!

04:46.050 --> 04:49.600
Saki-chan and Tomoka-chan's
combo play was fantastic, too!

04:49.600 --> 04:51.810
You guys have really improved.

04:53.560 --> 04:54.890
Although, Saki-chan,

04:55.230 --> 04:57.770
you were a little soft on Airi-chan, weren't you?

04:57.980 --> 04:58.900
Yeah...

04:58.900 --> 05:01.400
I moved to the back too but,

05:01.400 --> 05:04.820
I would have loved to see Saki and Airi go one-on-one.

05:04.820 --> 05:06.200
R-Really?

05:06.200 --> 05:07.240
That is true.

05:07.240 --> 05:09.530
A one-on-one would be interesting.

05:10.740 --> 05:12.750
Let's do it the next time round, Airi.

05:12.750 --> 05:13.660
Okay!

05:13.660 --> 05:15.330
I won't lose.

05:15.540 --> 05:18.330
Spot on as usual, Aoi.

05:18.330 --> 05:22.670
Well, we girls know what's going on amongst ourselves.

05:22.920 --> 05:25.470
I'm really happy you're here.

05:26.680 --> 05:29.720
I-It's not like I'm doing it for you...

05:34.980 --> 05:36.440
I'm back.

05:36.440 --> 05:37.810
Welcome home.

05:39.440 --> 05:41.570
Your dad wants to speak to you.

05:51.030 --> 05:52.870
I've just returned home.

05:52.870 --> 05:54.080
Tomoka.

05:54.080 --> 05:55.910
Sit over there for a bit.

05:56.080 --> 05:56.960
Okay.

06:05.920 --> 06:09.220
It seems like you've been pouring lots of your time into basketball recently.

06:12.010 --> 06:14.640
Your studies, the Way of Tea, and dancing.
Those are things you also have to do.

06:14.640 --> 06:17.390
I will not be amused if you get lazy with them.

06:28.570 --> 06:30.530
<i>Twice in a row, huh?</i>

06:38.830 --> 06:40.620
Did something happen?

06:41.000 --> 06:43.040
Actually, yesterday...

06:43.040 --> 06:44.800
I got a lecture from my dad.

06:44.800 --> 06:45.710
What?!

06:45.710 --> 06:47.800
Even <i>you</i> get lectured?

06:48.090 --> 06:49.550
Quite often, yes...

06:49.550 --> 06:51.470
I-I see...

06:51.470 --> 06:56.350
I was told to refrain from going out during the summer holidays.

06:56.600 --> 07:00.640
Actually, there's a summer festival this Saturday too,

07:00.640 --> 07:02.900
but I'm not allowed to go.

07:02.900 --> 07:04.310
No way...

07:04.310 --> 07:05.230
But why?

07:05.230 --> 07:08.610
My dad was against me playing basketball in the first place,

07:08.610 --> 07:11.860
and because I've been doing nothing but playing basketball recently,

07:11.860 --> 07:13.700
I don't think he's too happy with me.

07:14.990 --> 07:17.200
I feel bad for everyone, but...

07:17.200 --> 07:18.910
I guess I don't have a choice.

07:25.000 --> 07:26.340
What?!

07:26.340 --> 07:28.130
Mokkan's not going?

07:28.340 --> 07:29.590
That's no fun!

07:29.590 --> 07:30.590
You idiot!

07:30.590 --> 07:33.430
I'm sure that Tomo doesn't want to miss out either.

07:34.850 --> 07:35.850
I'm sorry.

07:36.180 --> 07:39.390
I'm sure every family has their own situations...

07:39.390 --> 07:42.850
It seems like Tomoka-chan has been juggling her studies and practices.

07:42.850 --> 07:46.400
Oh! Tomoka's a hard worker.

07:46.690 --> 07:49.610
I'm not sure if it'll be of any help, but...

07:49.610 --> 07:52.150
do you want us to ask your father?

07:52.530 --> 07:54.070
It's fine.

07:54.070 --> 07:55.950
I'm glad you feel this way,

07:55.950 --> 07:56.990
but it's okay.

07:56.990 --> 07:59.910
Go and enjoy yourselves at the festival, okay?

08:11.880 --> 08:13.840
Nee-sama, is this fine?

08:16.090 --> 08:18.470
It's too tight!

08:34.070 --> 08:35.950
Yanbaru!

08:42.000 --> 08:44.210
I wonder if it's too short...

08:51.920 --> 08:54.550
Is Tomo really not coming?

08:59.600 --> 09:02.810
<i>It'll be bad for Tomoka if this continues.</i>

09:03.810 --> 09:05.600
<i>I might be a busybody,</i>

09:05.600 --> 09:07.100
<i>but maybe I should just...</i>

09:12.030 --> 09:15.030
Inbox:

09:12.030 --> 09:15.030
Nagatsuka Saki
To Hasegawa-san

09:12.480 --> 09:15.030
<i>Have you heard from Tomoka?</i>

09:15.320 --> 09:16.280
<i>Nope.</i>

09:16.280 --> 09:19.830
<i>I'm going to go to her house and try to negotiate with her father.</i>

09:24.910 --> 09:27.170
Inbox:

09:24.910 --> 09:27.170
Nagatsuka Saki
To Hasegawa-san

09:25.160 --> 09:27.120
<i>I'm counting on you.</i>

09:32.710 --> 09:33.630
Okay then!

09:33.630 --> 09:34.880
Subaru-kun!

09:35.220 --> 09:36.510
You have a call.

09:36.510 --> 09:38.390
It's from Tomoka-chan's mother.

09:38.390 --> 09:39.510
What?

09:42.060 --> 09:45.060
Name

09:42.060 --> 09:45.060
Minato Tomoka

09:42.100 --> 09:45.060
Birthday

09:42.140 --> 09:45.060
Blood Type

09:42.220 --> 09:45.060
Class

09:42.260 --> 09:45.060
Height

09:42.310 --> 09:45.060
Bust Size

09:42.310 --> 09:45.060
Indistinct (is something she's very concerned about)

09:42.350 --> 09:45.060
Words to Subaru

09:42.350 --> 09:45.060
I... I respect you with all my heart!

09:55.690 --> 09:56.570
Tomoka!

09:57.400 --> 09:58.450
Subaru-san?

09:58.740 --> 09:59.530
Tomoka!

10:00.240 --> 10:00.990
Subaru-san!

10:19.430 --> 10:20.890
It's nice being young, isn't it?

10:22.640 --> 10:24.390
Good day, Subaru-san.

10:24.390 --> 10:27.680
Um, I really need to thank you.

10:27.680 --> 10:29.560
I thought it would be too much for Tomoka,

10:29.560 --> 10:31.400
being the only one unable to go.

10:31.860 --> 10:36.150
Also, I feel at ease with you at her side.

10:36.610 --> 10:38.400
Thanks, Mom.

10:38.400 --> 10:39.400
I'll get going now.

10:46.370 --> 10:49.290
To think I would be allowed to go...

10:49.290 --> 10:50.290
It's so surprising.

10:50.290 --> 10:52.790
Yeah. I'm really glad for you.

10:53.670 --> 10:56.300
I'm able to see you, too.

10:56.670 --> 10:59.550
You look really good in that yukata.

11:09.180 --> 11:11.400
Did we get here too early?

11:11.900 --> 11:13.400
Where are we supposed to meet?

11:14.190 --> 11:16.190
In front of the sweet apricot store,

11:16.480 --> 11:18.610
but I can't reach any of them on my cellphone.

11:18.610 --> 11:19.990
Don't worry.

11:19.990 --> 11:21.820
We'll meet up soon.

11:21.820 --> 11:25.370
Since we're already here, let's walk around and see the shops.

11:25.370 --> 11:27.290
Oh? Look at that.

11:33.170 --> 11:35.210
A free-throw store, huh?

11:35.210 --> 11:36.920
Well, wanna give it a go?

11:39.210 --> 11:40.970
I wonder how it'll go.

11:40.970 --> 11:42.720
I'm in a yukata, after all.

11:43.590 --> 11:46.010
All right, here's a chance to get a reward from me.

11:46.010 --> 11:49.100
If you score two shots out of three, I'll do anything you say.

11:49.100 --> 11:49.730
What?!

11:49.930 --> 11:51.730
A-Anything?

11:51.730 --> 11:54.060
Yep. Anything.

11:54.060 --> 11:55.360
How about it?

12:02.740 --> 12:03.910
We have a winner!

12:03.910 --> 12:06.660
Three out of three perfect shots!

12:08.330 --> 12:10.160
That was great, Tomoka.

12:11.620 --> 12:14.420
It's all thanks to you cheering for me, Subaru-san.

12:18.130 --> 12:20.800
Um, Subaru-san...

12:20.800 --> 12:21.920
There's also...

12:22.670 --> 12:23.470
What is it?

12:23.470 --> 12:25.390
I-It's um...

12:26.090 --> 12:28.180
It's about what you promised earlier.

12:28.180 --> 12:30.100
Oh, yeah.

12:30.100 --> 12:31.430
The reward, right?

12:31.430 --> 12:33.440
Y-Yes.

12:33.440 --> 12:34.600
Actually...

12:34.600 --> 12:36.190
Um...

12:36.190 --> 12:39.400
F-Fireworks! I want you to see them together with me!

12:40.190 --> 12:42.440
You're talking about the festival's fireworks?

12:43.950 --> 12:46.200
As close as possible.

12:46.990 --> 12:49.240
Right by your side.

12:50.700 --> 12:51.790
All right.

12:51.790 --> 12:53.960
I'll watch the fireworks with you.

13:06.050 --> 13:08.550
Oh, it's from Tomoka.

13:08.550 --> 13:12.100
Oh, is Tomoka here yet?

13:12.100 --> 13:12.850
Yep.

13:12.850 --> 13:16.440
Apparently she's with Hasegawa-san, and they've just left the free-throw store.

13:16.440 --> 13:17.310
All right!

13:17.310 --> 13:18.860
Let's meet up with them right away.

13:18.860 --> 13:19.820
We can't do that...

13:19.820 --> 13:21.530
Not when they're finally by themselves.

13:21.530 --> 13:24.570
In that case, let's do whatever we want to for now!

13:24.570 --> 13:27.280
I want to go scoop some goldfishes.

13:27.280 --> 13:31.120
Oh! Hina wants to do that too!

13:31.120 --> 13:34.120
And then have some chocolate banana after that!

13:34.120 --> 13:36.160
Let's do this, then. We'll split into two groups

13:36.160 --> 13:37.670
and meet up afterwards.

13:37.670 --> 13:38.750
Sure!

13:38.750 --> 13:40.540
I wanna have some candy floss!

13:40.540 --> 13:41.630
Okay, okay.

13:44.340 --> 13:45.090
Huh?

13:45.380 --> 13:47.630
This is the meeting place, right?

13:47.630 --> 13:49.340
I wonder what's holding them up.

13:52.680 --> 13:53.680
Tomoka?

13:55.520 --> 13:56.770
What's wrong?

13:58.940 --> 14:00.520
Well...

14:01.770 --> 14:02.980
Don't tell me...

14:02.980 --> 14:03.530
You have to use the toilet?

14:05.780 --> 14:07.240
Y-Yes...

14:07.240 --> 14:10.280
I was holding it in all this time, so...

14:10.280 --> 14:11.700
You can't move?

14:13.660 --> 14:15.080
Okay. I got it.

14:15.080 --> 14:16.450
Let's see...

14:16.450 --> 14:17.410
How about this?

14:18.960 --> 14:19.790
Let's go.

14:27.420 --> 14:29.260
<i>Thank god I made it.</i>

14:33.430 --> 14:34.640
Get out of the way, old man.

14:37.020 --> 14:39.520
Um, are you okay?

14:39.690 --> 14:40.560
Yes.

14:40.560 --> 14:43.020
I dropped my glasses, though.

14:43.690 --> 14:44.770
That's no good.

14:46.230 --> 14:47.400
Excuse me.

14:47.780 --> 14:50.410
There's a pair of glasses on the ground,
so please allow me to look for them.

14:55.200 --> 14:56.120
<i>There they are.</i>

14:57.330 --> 14:58.290
Are these your glasses?

14:58.870 --> 15:00.080
Ah, yes.

15:00.790 --> 15:02.290
Thank you for being so kind.

15:02.540 --> 15:03.500
You're welcome.

15:03.500 --> 15:05.300
I'm glad they were found.

15:06.170 --> 15:08.470
I came looking for my daughter,

15:08.470 --> 15:10.550
but it would seem I'm not so good with crowds.

15:10.880 --> 15:12.220
I can appreciate that.

15:12.220 --> 15:13.390
I'm the same.

15:14.600 --> 15:15.890
Thanks again.

15:15.890 --> 15:17.180
You really helped.

15:24.650 --> 15:26.110
You can do it, Nii-tan!

15:27.650 --> 15:29.400
You guys are distracting me.

15:33.620 --> 15:36.080
Hey, isn't that Natsuhi?

15:36.990 --> 15:38.200
What are you doing?

15:38.200 --> 15:39.120
Shooting?

15:39.120 --> 15:40.580
Whoa, seems like fun!

15:40.790 --> 15:41.920
I wanna try too!

15:41.920 --> 15:43.210
Lend that to me!

15:43.420 --> 15:44.040
Huh?

15:44.040 --> 15:45.590
What's your problem, stupid Maho?

15:45.590 --> 15:47.090
Stop getting in Nii-tan's way!

15:47.090 --> 15:49.300
What? Why can't I play?

15:49.300 --> 15:50.130
Because you can't!

15:50.130 --> 15:51.130
You're not allowed to, Maho!

15:51.130 --> 15:52.590
Come on now, Tsubaki and Hiiragi.

15:54.640 --> 15:56.430
Here, do what you want.

15:58.310 --> 16:00.680
Well, I don't think you have what it takes though.

16:02.440 --> 16:03.440
Let's go.

16:06.650 --> 16:08.230
Wait for us, Nii-tan!

16:08.230 --> 16:11.610
Tsubaki and Hiiragi are being as spiteful as usual.

16:11.610 --> 16:13.660
Pay no attention to it!

16:14.410 --> 16:16.410
All right! Here I go!

16:21.710 --> 16:24.290
You keep leaning over like that and you're gonna fall.

16:24.290 --> 16:26.840
Ah, Maho and Saki!

16:28.170 --> 16:29.420
Shooting, huh?

16:32.300 --> 16:33.220
M-Maho!

16:33.220 --> 16:34.340
Your underwear!

16:35.680 --> 16:37.680
Don't look, Subaru!

16:40.470 --> 16:43.310
Congratulations!

16:44.480 --> 16:46.100
You're awful, Subaru.

16:46.100 --> 16:47.610
M-My bad...

16:47.610 --> 16:51.610
You're the one who leaned forward so much that they could be seen, Maho.

16:51.610 --> 16:53.320
Well then why don't you try too, Saki?

16:53.320 --> 16:55.360
If your panties can't be seen, then I'll forgive him.

16:55.360 --> 16:57.240
Of course they can't be seen!

16:58.990 --> 17:01.490
Why did it come to this?

17:03.910 --> 17:04.660
Like this.

17:04.660 --> 17:07.040
Try bringing it a little closer to your body.

17:08.790 --> 17:09.750
Okay!

17:12.380 --> 17:13.880
Ah, so close!

17:14.340 --> 17:16.010
You got pretty close.

17:16.010 --> 17:16.840
Yes.

17:16.840 --> 17:20.140
Thank you for showing me how to do it, though.

17:29.770 --> 17:32.230
Oh! Delicious!

17:32.230 --> 17:32.780
Yeah.

17:32.780 --> 17:34.030
Hey!

17:40.200 --> 17:42.410
Wow, what a view!

17:42.410 --> 17:45.330
This place has a great view, and isn't very well known.

17:45.330 --> 17:47.620
It's almost time for the fireworks.

17:47.620 --> 17:48.370
Yeah.

17:48.370 --> 17:49.500
Tomoka.

17:52.340 --> 17:53.340
Father!

17:54.590 --> 17:57.380
I thought I told you to refrain from going out.

17:57.380 --> 17:59.260
I-I'm sorry.

17:59.260 --> 17:59.840
But...

17:59.840 --> 18:00.800
We're going home.

18:04.560 --> 18:05.480
Please hold on!

18:08.270 --> 18:09.310
You are?

18:09.310 --> 18:12.360
I'm the coach for the basketball team at Keishin Academy.

18:12.360 --> 18:14.730
My name is Hasegawa Subaru.

18:14.730 --> 18:18.530
I'm really sorry for acting out of place and bringing Tomoka-san out.

18:18.530 --> 18:20.200
That's...

18:20.200 --> 18:22.450
That's not it! It's because I asked Mom...

18:22.450 --> 18:23.200
No.

18:23.740 --> 18:27.330
In the end, I'm the one who caused her to break the promise.

18:27.330 --> 18:29.330
I'm really sorry.

18:29.330 --> 18:32.750
But Tomoka-san's a good girl.

18:32.750 --> 18:35.050
She's well-mannered, and is very serious about basketball.

18:35.460 --> 18:36.840
Subaru-san...

18:37.340 --> 18:38.760
Oh?

18:40.010 --> 18:42.510
You speak like you know everything about her.

18:42.510 --> 18:46.980
The reason why she's here isn't because she takes the promise with you lightly,

18:46.980 --> 18:50.520
but because she just wholeheartedly wants to be with her friends.

18:50.940 --> 18:54.270
That's how important her friends are to her!

18:55.400 --> 18:57.070
Friends, you say?

18:57.940 --> 19:00.780
Tomoka has no need for basketball friends.

19:00.780 --> 19:03.200
Father! That is...

19:03.200 --> 19:04.330
That's just cruel!

19:10.960 --> 19:14.000
Oh? You're that young man from before.

19:16.550 --> 19:19.260
You're Tomoka's coach?

19:19.260 --> 19:20.470
Yes.

19:20.470 --> 19:22.010
I'm their coach.

19:22.260 --> 19:24.890
We need Tomo!

19:24.890 --> 19:26.100
That's right!

19:26.100 --> 19:30.480
If Mokkan wasn't there, I wouldn't have found basketball so cool and fun!

19:30.730 --> 19:33.060
Hina loves Tomoka too.

19:33.060 --> 19:35.400
Just like everyone else. We all love her.

19:35.400 --> 19:40.650
It's because of Tomoka-chan. It's all thanks to her that we're able to play basketball.

19:41.070 --> 19:43.240
I'm sorry for going out,

19:43.240 --> 19:45.950
but please, don't speak badly of them.

19:45.950 --> 19:51.080
It's all thanks to Subaru and everyone that I can enjoy basketball again.

19:51.080 --> 19:51.920
So please!

19:52.210 --> 19:56.920
Please don't take Tomoka away, or take us away from Tomoka!

19:56.920 --> 19:57.960
Please!

20:07.720 --> 20:09.140
Fine.

20:09.140 --> 20:10.430
Do as you please.

20:13.480 --> 20:14.980
Father...

20:18.230 --> 20:18.940
Um...

20:20.690 --> 20:25.700
I am sure you know, but Tomoka has had a horrible experience with basketball before.

20:27.370 --> 20:33.710
But it seems like basketball has allowed her to make some great friends this time round.

20:36.290 --> 20:38.210
This might be too much to ask,

20:38.210 --> 20:41.210
but please continue to take care of my daughter.

20:42.800 --> 20:43.970
I will!

20:52.390 --> 20:53.520
It's fine now.

20:55.230 --> 20:57.730
Well then, time to fulfill my promise.

20:59.730 --> 21:00.530
Yes!

21:19.710 --> 21:21.920
You're doing exceptionally well today!

21:21.920 --> 21:23.210
Really?

21:23.210 --> 21:25.010
Did something good happen?

21:25.010 --> 21:27.970
My father told me to try my hardest at basketball.

21:30.310 --> 21:31.510
I see.

21:36.940 --> 21:38.190
Nice shot.

21:42.690 --> 21:43.650
You are?

21:50.120 --> 21:52.490
I challenge you to a one-on-one.

21:52.870 --> 21:53.870
What?

21:56.580 --> 21:59.330
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

21:59.330 --> 22:00.870
Rolling! Rolling!

22:00.870 --> 22:03.790
Keep on bouncing!

22:02.080 --> 22:04.800
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

22:04.800 --> 22:07.210
Elementary schoolers are the best!

22:07.210 --> 22:07.590
Yay!

22:11.680 --> 22:16.680
Our bodies and our hearts are size SS,

22:17.180 --> 22:22.600
but our dreams can be size LL, can't they? Can't they?

22:22.600 --> 22:27.990
Adolescents have lots of troubles,

22:27.990 --> 22:33.570
but we'll overcome them together.

22:33.570 --> 22:39.000
I want to get even better!

22:34.370 --> 22:35.740
Even

22:35.740 --> 22:37.080
better!

22:39.000 --> 22:46.670
I want to see your face when I surprise you!

22:39.960 --> 22:40.620
Ooh!

22:41.290 --> 22:42.000
Wow!

22:46.880 --> 22:49.590
Just keep on spinning!

22:49.590 --> 22:53.510
The Earth is one big basketball!

22:53.510 --> 22:57.180
I'll believe in the future and move forward!

22:56.560 --> 22:58.100
I'll keep going!

22:57.810 --> 23:00.520
Just keep on spinning!

23:00.520 --> 23:04.480
The universe is one big basketball court!

23:04.480 --> 23:07.900
I want you to receive it.

23:07.190 --> 23:08.150
Ready, and!

23:07.900 --> 23:09.740
Pass! Pass! Pass!

23:10.150 --> 23:12.150
Please take it!

23:13.410 --> 23:16.160
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

23:16.160 --> 23:17.700
Rolling! Rolling!

23:17.700 --> 23:20.580
Keep on bouncing!

23:18.830 --> 23:21.580
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

23:21.580 --> 23:24.040
Elementary schoolers are the best!

23:24.040 --> 23:24.870
Yay!

23:26.000 --> 23:26.920
It's started!

23:26.920 --> 23:28.260
It's finally started!

23:28.260 --> 23:29.050
Calm down, Maho!

23:29.050 --> 23:30.590
Our preview's as short as always.

23:29.050 --> 23:30.590
Wow!

23:30.590 --> 23:33.760
Um, when Subaru-san and I were practicing in the morning...

23:30.590 --> 23:32.340
Woof! Woof!

23:32.340 --> 23:33.760
Meoooow!

23:33.760 --> 23:35.680
Wait a minute, Tomo! Be sure to not include any spoilers!

23:33.760 --> 23:35.680
Bang!

23:35.680 --> 23:36.560
What?!

23:36.010 --> 23:37.770
Whawhawhawha...

23:36.560 --> 23:37.770
Let's just throw in a greeting for now!

23:37.770 --> 23:38.560
Ready and...

23:38.020 --> 23:41.020
Flying Match

23:38.020 --> 23:41.020
Next episode

23:38.560 --> 23:40.980
Please continue supporting us!
